electromagnetic-induction-ask = When does a current flow in the coil?
electromagnetic-induction-title = A magnet and a coil: electromagnetic induction
electromagnetic-induction-choices = When the magnet and the coil move against each other
electromagnetic-induction-choices-2 = When the magnet lies in the coil
electromagnetic-induction-choices-3 = A magnet makes no current
electromagnetic-induction-turns-label = Turns in the coil
